      "side": 1,
      "message": "These match the existing 10-bit YUV values: I010/H010 \u003d 15, I210/H210 \u003d 20, so P010/P210/P410 are 15/20/30 (10 × 1.5/2/3).\n\nP010 is 10-bit 4:2:0, not 4-channel. 16bpc × 4ch \u003d 64 is AR64. Packed storage would be 24/32/48, still not 64. FOURCC_BPP is only a validity hint (0..64), not a buffer size.",
